      "review_summary": "The PR adds an undefined guard in `safeStringify` and a regression test for `summarizeAllowedValues([undefined])`.\n\nPR surface: Source +3, Tests +9. Total +12 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main falls through from `JSON.stringify(undefined)` to `String(value)`, and the PR body includes before/after direct TS output; I did not run tests because this review kept the checkout read-only.",
